# S18b, member b (k10): with a to the west end of stag0101, steps on matz02 and holds its prompt open (its yes waits
# for three members on the mat), then its script ends: the client leaves the room with the prompt open.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@91
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log in the field
route {route:stag0101_west:-308,-190}
wander -290 -190 5 until sealed>=1800 fail stagechange
log b steps on the mat
mat matz02 yes 3 until prompt=1,frames>=240 fail stagechange
log b leaves the room with its prompt open
